summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Published By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/magic-the-gathering/wizards-of-the-coast\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Published By\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Wizards of the Coast</strong>\n                    <span>Wizards of the Coast was founded by Peter Adkison and four friends in 1990 just outside of Seattle, Washington, and their headquarters is still in the nearby city of Renton. Original founders were also Rich Kaalaas, who…</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Published By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/wizards-of-the-coast\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Wizards of the Coast\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Wizards publishes Magic: The Gathering.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Magic: The Gathering is also referenced as MTG, Magic, Magic the Gathering franchise.</li><li>Wizards publishes Magic: The Gathering.</li><li>The card game is the primary Magic product.</li><li>Magic: The Gathering Cards is a medium branch of Magic: The Gathering.</li><li>Magic: The Gathering Tabletop is a medium branch of Magic: The Gathering.</li><li>Evidence around Magic: The Gathering is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Magic: The Gathering?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        Magic: The Gathering, also Magic or MTG, is a strategy card game created by Richard Garfield in 1993, and published by <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/wizards-of-the-coast\" class=\"entity-link\">Wizards of the Coast</a>.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        Magic holds the title of &quot;Most Played Trading Card Game&quot;, and is currently published in English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, and Spanish. Digitally, the game can be played in Magic Online and MTG Arena. Magic is not a single game but rather a game system that shares a set of rules and game components (mainly cards). It can be played in many different formats.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        Within the game of Magic, each player takes the role of a planeswalker, a powerful, magic-wielding being.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        The game is commonly played with two players but can be played with more. Each player uses their own deck, which may be constructed from cards they previously owned, or from a limited pool of cards at an event. There are several ways of winning the game, the most common being reducing your opponent to 0 life, from a starting total of 20.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"also-known-as\">\n        <strong>Also known as:</strong>\n        MTG, Magic, Magic the Gathering franchise.\n    </p>\n\n</section>","word_count":887,"uniqueness_score":"1.0000"},"entity":{"id":"46a2a3b8-53fd-4350-b29c-bc1bd8edf5d5","name":"Magic: The Gathering","slug":"magic-the-gathering","type":"topic","kind":"topic","type_label":"Topic","short_description":"Magic: The Gathering, also Magic or MTG, is a strategy card game created by Richard Garfield in 1993, and published by Wizards of the Coast.","description":"Magic: The Gathering, also Magic or MTG, is a strategy card game created by Richard Garfield in 1993, and published by Wizards of the Coast.\n\nMagic holds the title of \"Most Played Trading Card Game\", and is currently published in English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, and Spanish. Digitally, the game can be played in Magic Online and MTG Arena. Magic is not a single game but rather a game system that shares a set of rules and game components (mainly cards). It can be played in many different formats.\n\nWithin the game of Magic, each player takes the role of a planeswalker, a powerful, magic-wielding being.\n\nThe game is commonly played with two players but can be played with more. Each player uses their own deck, which may be constructed from cards they previously owned, or from a limited pool of cards at an event. There are several ways of winning the game, the most common being reducing your opponent to 0 life, from a starting total of 20.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"magic-the-gathering","aliases":["MTG","Magic","Magic the Gathering franchise"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":null,"image_source":null,"image_credit":null,"image_license":null,"image_usage":null,"image_alt":null},"connections":[{"id":"a6b2fe68-99a6-488d-967d-13b0b340803c","relationship":"contains","title":"Magic: The Gathering Tabletop is a medium branch of Magic: The Gathering.","explanation":"Magic: The Gathering Tabletop is a medium branch of Magic: The Gathering.","strength":"0.9900","discovery_score":"0.9600","direction":"outgoing","from_entity_id":"46a2a3b8-53fd-4350-b29c-bc1bd8edf5d5","to_entity_id":"7431e430-588d-4d50-9a7f-e12d4009b33f","entity_id":"7431e430-588d-4d50-9a7f-e12d4009b33f","slug":"magic-the-gathering-tabletop-hub","name":"Magic: The Gathering Tabletop","type":"topic","short_description":"Living card game as tabletop play.","evidence":"fiction","image_url":null,"path":"/magic-the-gathering/magic-the-gathering-tabletop-hub","kind":"topic","type_label":"Topic"},{"id":"c0959ed9-6f36-4418-95d1-11f6c6196b39","relationship":"contains","title":"Magic: The Gathering Cards is a medium branch of Magic: The Gathering.","explanation":"Magic: The Gathering Cards is a medium branch of Magic: The Gathering.","strength":"0.9900","discov